<h3>Report viewer</h3>
<p>
    The <strong>Report viewer</strong> can be used to setup the report predefined filtes, run the report and display the report data
</p>

<h4>Actions</h4>
<table>
    <tr><td>QUERY</td><td>Shows the query of the report.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>RUN</td><td>Launch the query of the report.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>QUIT</td><td>Closes the report editor and returns to the page report list.</td></tr>
</table>